---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE_NAME}`} description={`About ${SITE_NAME}: factory tire sizes by vehicle, taken from owner's manuals.`}>
  <section>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>{SITE_NAME} answers one question: what size tires did your car come with? We take the answer from the carmaker's owner's manual for each model year, not from retailer catalogs, and we show the page it comes from.</p>
    <p>We're an independent site. We aren't connected with any carmaker or tire brand. Some links to tire stores are affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. That never changes which sizes we list.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
